    <briefdescription>
<para>Indicates that the Bluetooth stack requests the bonding data of a connection from the external bonding database. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The application must respond by setting bonding data using the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__external__bondingdb_1ga466391986f5931598e6d14dc8b1dd391" kindref="member">sl_bt_external_bondingdb_set_data</ref> command.</para>
<para>The Bluetooth stack will send this event one or more times after a connection is open following the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__connection__opened" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_connection_opened</ref> event to get ready for security related operations. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
